{
  "slug": "goalkeeper",
  "name": "Goalkeeper",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Durable, contract-driven goal execution for long-running autonomous tasks. After every checkpoint a subagent judge, fresh context, anti-placeholder, reviews the diff and progress log against an explicit Definition of Done,\nreturning approve or a structured fix-list; after 5 rejections it pauses for human help. Linear chains compose role-specific contracts with judge-gated handoff between links.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **8 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (8): `goal` (Set or check status of a durable goalkeeper goal), `goal-chain` (Run a linear sequence of goalkeeper goals where the judge gates progression between them), `goal-clear` (Stop and archive the currently active goalkeeper goal), `goal-judge` (The gate), `goal-pause` (Pause the currently active goalkeeper goal without losing state), `goal-prep` (Interactively draft a goalkeeper contract before executing), `goal-resume` (Resume a paused or needs_human goalkeeper goal), `goal-supervisor` (The mission-level supervisor)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install goalkeeper@claude-community` from `itsuzef/goalkeeper`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "wrapper",
  "wrapper": "skill",
  "sourceType": "community",
